      <li><a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">World Economic Forum, Future of Jobs Report 2025</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://nasscom.in/knowledge-center/publications/indias-journey-tech-talent-nation-skills-first-approach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASSCOM, India's Journey to a Tech Talent Nation</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://blog.adobe.com/en/topics/design" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adobe design blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.figma.com/blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Figma blog and product learning resources</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</CareerResourceLayout>
